---
description: NodeFF Build authority and no-product-invention rules
alwaysApply: true
---

- This repository implements NodeFF; it does not define product truth.
- Product Design Current Truth lives in OWNER/PRODUCT-DESIGN-REPO/working/.
- During implementation, the ONLY product input is the active locked baseline referenced by build-spec/CURRENT.json.
- Never use chat, code behavior, old commits, comments, or library constraints as product authority.
- Never create or edit a shadow working/spec/execution tree in this repo.
- If no active locked baseline or active Sprint exists, product implementation is HOLD.
- Never modify an existing build-spec/baselines/BS-*/ directory.
- If two reasonable product behaviors are possible and the locked contract does not choose one: STOP the affected task, record SPEC_AMBIGUITY, and do not guess.
